id: pm-g0b88h
title: "Bound embedding requests, enforce retrieval floors, and protect schema previews"
description: "Deliver shared SDK batching and retrieval-quality primitives for pm-vjgqj5 and pm-p1g43q: encoded payload bounds, adaptive HTTP 413 splitting, execution receipts, per-query quality floors and fail-closed repository ratchets. Also deliver shared CLI and SDK/MCP schema preview admission for pm-s74dca and persist the Changeset type so clean-checkout changelogs are reproducible."
type: Changeset
status: closed
priority: 1
tags[3]: quality,sdk,search
created_at: "2026-09-25T14:43:31.575Z"
updated_at: "2026-09-25T16:28:19.470Z"
closed_at: "2026-09-25T16:28:18.634Z"
completed_at: "2026-09-25T16:28:18.634Z"
author: "harness:codex"
acceptance_criteria: Real loopback and Ollama batching preserve vector order and bounded payloads; individual retrieval regressions fail despite passing aggregate scores; invalid negative-control runs cannot count as gate evidence; public SDK contracts and docs are current.
parent: pm-ydp6
resolution: "Delivered bounded adaptive embedding requests and public SDK receipts, per-query retrieval floors and negative-control admission, shared safe schema preview dispatch, portable Changeset schema, and changelog generation with published upstream pm-changelog 2026.9.25."
expected_result: "Bounded ordered embeddings, query-specific quality failures, mutation-free refused previews and reproducible clean-checkout changelog output."
actual_result: "Real HTTP, Ollama, temporary CLI/public SDK, packed npx/bunx, retrieval, graph/history and operational checks pass. Exact full-source coverage is 100 on all axes; the sole latest directory-cap failure was fixed and focused reruns pass. Hosted checks must pass before merge; broader scale criteria remain open on canonical items and local transport budgets also fail on unchanged main."
